  "content": "<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblockfactory.studio%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1745/823/icon-website-png.png\" alt=\"網站\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@blockfactoryMC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1745/821/icon-youtube-png.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fBlockFactoryMC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1745/822/icon-x-png.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fVGQZCrH\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1745/820/icon-discord-png.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540blockfactorymc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1745/824/icon-tiktok-png.png\" alt=\"TikTok\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fblockfactorystudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1745/826/icon-instagram-png.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pinterest.com%252fBlockFactoryStudio%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1745/825/icon-pinterest-png.png\" alt=\"Pinterest\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1314084/description_def74001-37f3-44e4-873d-db139e74f454.png\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnews.blockfactory.studio%252fnewsletter%253fsource%253dcurseforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1819/786/newsletter-strip-png.png\" alt=\"新聞通訊\"></a>\n<strong>《Bosses'Rise》為 Minecraft 帶來 5 個類魂系 Boss：多階段戰鬥、自訂戰場以及值得你滿身傷痕去爭取的裝備。</strong>\n<h2>📋 關於</h2>\n《Bosses'Rise》將 Boss 戰轉變為真正的遭遇戰。每個 Boss 都有獨立的戰場、招式和階段，這些階段會改變你的玩法，因此勝利取決於讀懂戰鬥節奏，而非硬扛傷害。\n<h2>⚔️ 內容介紹</h2>\n5 個類魂系 Boss 戰 - 具有獨特攻擊模式的多階段遭遇戰\n獨特的 Boss - 地獄龍、冥府騎士、雪人、海怪等\n自訂戰場 - Boss 會在世界各處的手動建造結構中生成\n豐厚的戰利品 - 擊敗每個 Boss 都能獲得專屬裝備和獎勵\n新生物 - 新鮮的生物讓每個 Boss 區域充滿生機\n<h2>🐲 投票選出下一個 Boss</h2>\n訂閱上方的新聞通訊，投票選出下一個 Boss、我們的即將推出的模組等。\n<h2>🚀 支援版本</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.1</strong> - NeoForge</li>\n<li><strong>1.20.1</strong> - Forge</li>\n</ul>",
